title: "IMPACT: Intention-Modulated Personalized ACT-R"
abstract: "A hybrid sequential/cognitive-memory music recommender system extending SASRec
  with a personalised popularity signal derived from the ACT-R cognitive architecture,
  weighted by listen intentionality."
